# Build and Release Folders
bin-debug/
bin-release/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]in/

# Other files and folders
.settings/

# Executables
*.swf
*.air
*.ipa
*.apk

# Project files, i.e. `.project`, `.actionScriptProperties` and `.flexProperties`
# should NOT be excluded as they contain compiler settings and other important
# information for Eclipse / Flash Builder.
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
🚫 NEXUS ADS ENGINE — .gitignore
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
─── Données runtime (JAMAIS commit) ───
ads_engine_data/ ads_engine_data/* !ads_engine_data/.gitkeep
─── Base SQLite ───
*.db *.db-journal *.db-wal *.db-shm *.sqlite *.sqlite3 ads.db ads.db-wal ads.db-shm ads.db-journal
─── Backups ───
backups/ backups/* *.backup *.bak *.old
─── Logs ───
logs/ logs/* *.log .log. audit.log ads_engine.log
─── Lock files ───
.lock .lock .lock.
─── Python ───
pycache/ pycache/* .py[cod] $py.class .so .Python build/ build/ develop-eggs/ dist/ dist/ downloads/ eggs/ .eggs/ lib/ lib64/ parts/ sdist/ var/ wheels/ .egg-info/ .installed.cfg .egg MANIFEST venv/ venv/ .venv/ .venv/ ENV/ env/ ENV/
─── Python caches ───
.pytest_cache/ .pytest_cache/* .mypy_cache/ .mypy_cache/* .dmypy.json dmypy.json .pyre/ .pyre/* .ruff_cache/ .ruff_cache/*
─── IDE ───
.vscode/ .vscode/* !.vscode/settings.json !.vscode/extensions.json .idea/ .idea/* *.swp *.swo *~ *.orig *.rej
─── OS ───
.DS_Store .DS_Store? ._* .Spotlight-V100 .Trashes Thumbs.db ehthumbs.db Desktop.ini $RECYCLE.BIN/
─── Env et secrets ───
.env .env.* !.env.example *.env .env.local secrets/ secrets/ credentials.json tokens.json api_keys.txt
─── Node (si tu ajoutes un front) ───
node_modules/ node_modules/* npm-debug.log* yarn-debug.log* yarn-error.log* .pnpm-debug.log*
─── Docker (si tu ajoutes) ───
.dockerignore docker-compose.override.yml *.pid *.seed
─── Temp ───
tmp/ tmp/* temp/ temp/* *.tmp *.temp *.cache *.pid *.seed
─── Archives ───
*.zip *.tar *.tar.gz *.tgz *.rar *.7z
─── NEXUS spécifique ───
.nexus/ nexus_.db nexus_.log nexus_state.json nexus_alerts.json
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
Ce qui DOIT être commit :
✓ ads_engine.py
✓ README.md
✓ .gitignore
✓ LICENSE
✓ .env.example (si tu en crées un)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
